{"seq":1,"slug":"interpolation-extrapolation","title":"插值与外推","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/techniques/interpolation-extrapolation","wordCount":1252,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"插值与外推\">插值与外推</h1><p>服务器每秒大概只发 20 到 60 张快照，每张里远端玩家的位置都是一个孤立的采样点；而你的屏幕每秒要画 60 甚至 144 帧。如果直接把收到的位置&quot;啪&quot;地贴上去，远端角色就会以快照频率一跳一跳地瞬移，遇到抖动还会忽前忽后。插值与外推就是把这些稀疏、滞后、偶尔缺失的采样点，重建成连续顺滑运动的两套互补手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-渲染时间落在过去\">核心概念：渲染时间落在过去</h2><p>插值的核心决定是：客户端不渲染&quot;最新收到的&quot;那个位置，而是有意把渲染时刻设在过去一小段时间——通常 100 毫秒左右。这样在任意渲染帧，手里都已经有了该时刻&quot;前后两张&quot;快照，可以在它们之间插值，得到平滑的中间位置。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>render</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>interp_delay</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{render}} = t_{\\text{now}} - t_{\\text{interp\\_delay}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">render</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">interp_delay</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个有意的延迟，正是 <a href=\"../foundations/latency-bandwidth\">延迟、带宽与抖动</a> 里说的&quot;用缓冲换平滑&quot;：缓冲必须足够大以覆盖抖动与一个快照间隔，否则会出现没有未来快照可插值的空窗。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[收到快照 t0, t1, t2...] --&gt; B[存入插值缓冲]&#10;  B --&gt; C[渲染时刻 = now - 插值延迟]&#10;  C --&gt; D{渲染时刻落在&lt;br/&gt;哪两张快照之间?}&#10;  D --&gt;|有前后两张| E[线性/曲线插值&lt;br/&gt;得中间位置]&#10;  D --&gt;|落在最新快照之后| F[外推: 按速度推算]&#10;  E --&gt; G[平滑渲染]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[收到快照 t0, t1, t2...] --&gt; B[存入插值缓冲]\n  B --&gt; C[渲染时刻 = now - 插值延迟]\n  C --&gt; D{渲染时刻落在&lt;br/&gt;哪两张快照之间?}\n  D --&gt;|有前后两张| E[线性/曲线插值&lt;br/&gt;得中间位置]\n  D --&gt;|落在最新快照之后| F[外推: 按速度推算]\n  E --&gt; G[平滑渲染]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"实体插值-在两点之间补帧\">实体插值：在两点之间补帧</h2><p>最常用的是<strong>线性插值</strong>（lerp）：已知实体在快照时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\"